                <created>Fri, 1 Jun 2018 14:51:52 +0000</created>
                <updated>Fri, 27 Jul 2018 16:25:43 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Mon, 16 Jul 2018 16:10:52 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>2.7</fixVersion>
                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>3</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16501718" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 5 Jun 2018 12:56:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mcherkasov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mcherkasov&quot;&gt;mcherkasov&lt;/a&gt; do you know Igniter who can review this change? Could you mention him in ticket?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16507035" author="dpavlov" created="Sat, 9 Jun 2018 15:25:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mcherkasov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mcherkasov&quot;&gt;mcherkasov&lt;/a&gt;, could you also share TC run? &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16512543" author="mcherkasov" created="Thu, 14 Jun 2018 14:30:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt; TC looks good:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4109%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4109%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; could you please take a look at this changeset and push it to master repo?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16527346" author="agoncharuk" created="Fri, 29 Jun 2018 09:03:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Not quite agree with the change. If localHost is &lt;tt&gt;0.0.0.0&lt;/tt&gt;, then the check &lt;tt&gt;addr.equals(locHost)&lt;/tt&gt; will be &lt;tt&gt;false&lt;/tt&gt;, and we may attempt to connect to the local node.&lt;br/&gt;
If &lt;tt&gt;locHost&lt;/tt&gt; is &lt;tt&gt;0.0.0.0&lt;/tt&gt;, we need to capture all local IPs during the server start and check if we are connecting to one of those addresses.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16527624" author="mcherkasov" created="Fri, 29 Jun 2018 13:22:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; I fixed this, now first I check for port equality, then I check if address equals to local OR if we listen on 0:0:0:0 I check&#160;if remote address belongs to any local interface.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16545419" author="agoncharuk" created="Mon, 16 Jul 2018 16:10:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mcherkasov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mcherkasov&quot;&gt;mcherkasov&lt;/a&gt;, merged your changes to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16559967" author="dpavlov" created="Fri, 27 Jul 2018 16:25:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, fix version is empty. I&apos;ve set 2.7, please set another version if commit was cherry-picked.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
